      "interviewExplanation": "This is a tiny dynamic program. i >> 1 drops the lowest bit and is smaller than i, so its count is already computed, and I add back i & 1. Each entry takes constant time, O(n) overall. An equivalent recurrence is bits[i] = bits[i & (i - 1)] + 1, which clears the lowest set bit instead.",
